  "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts two women, both wearing hijabs, sharing a joyful moment as one gently touches the pregnant belly of the other. The text overlay reads 'it's a boy,' indicating the announcement of a male child. The scene is warm, celebratory, and centered on maternal joy and female camaraderie. There is no toxicity present in the image. The meme does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful content related to race, religion, gender, or any other protected characteristic. The intent is to convey a positive, personal announcement of a baby's gender, using the visual of two women bonding over the pregnancy. The juxtaposition of the text with the image serves to highlight the happiness and shared experience of the moment, without any propagandistic, hateful, or abusive elements. The meme is celebratory and culturally neutral in its presentation, focusing on universal themes of joy and anticipation.",
